{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんは！\n \n けやき坂46の加藤史帆です！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBAW6WJKBYA68D8PQ9WMS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n みーぱん(佐々木美玲)が書いてくれた私の似顔絵∩^ω^∩\n \n いつもまつげがふさふさだからまつげをたくさん書いてくれました☺︎\n ありがとうみーぱん！お家にかざってます♪\n \n \n 今日は1st Anniversary Liveの写真を載せたいと思います！\n マネージャーさんが撮ってくれました☺︎♪\n \n ☆ひらがなけやき☆\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBBX2A213GG7QTN0G48JA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBCXRKZACA8155KAA6Z3F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n ☆ダンストラック☆\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBE082D31SXV0JAJETKNA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBF00ZZ01AEX97J660MGS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n ☆誰よりも高く跳べ！☆\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBG09ZBB116GKMW7BYVNS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n ☆僕たちは付き合っている☆\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBGZ8A0F57QV7HM0YRQDN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBHZRH1XN5TT0CXJ7Z36G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBK242CTAP4YP8XGGCK0P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n こんな感じです！！\n \n ライブではよくハーフツインのくるりんぱをするんですけど、この日は珍しくおろしの巻き髪でした∩^ω^∩\n \n この時ちょうど髪色が明るかったので、加藤史帆って分かりやすかったかなぁって思います！(笑)\n \n 最後にひらがな12人の円陣！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZBKZZZM2YX9D5GRK2Z4HW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n まお(井口眞緒)がライブで言っていた 来年も11人が大好き！っていう言葉、私もそう思います\n \n おやすみなさい☆\n \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}